nt CLI target compiles tools/cli/core/main.cpp and that file implements the described artifact helpers. Update four Markdown links and one plain authority reference to the established existing source. No production source changes.\n\nThe two existing README DeepWiki URLs still return HTTP 429 with x-vercel-mitigated: challenge; a transient rate limit could not be established. Check those exact two URLs separately with bounded curl retries (two retries, ten-second delay, bounded transfer/retry times). A final 429 emits an explicit availability-unverified warning, not a successful verification claim; other unsuccessful statuses and connection failures fail the step. The main lychee action remains fail=true with all prior inputs/exclusions unchanged except these two URLs routed to the explicit check. No global 429 acceptance or host-wide exclusion.\n\nLocal validation on macOS ARM64 using CI's pinned lychee 0.18.1 and exact action command: 406 checks, 392 successful, 14 excluded, zero errors. DeepWiki step completed with two explicit 429 warnings after retries. Before/after --dump inventories show 236 previously checked unique URLs = 234 still checked by lychee + the two URLs checked by curl, with no other coverage changes. Seven focused curl-response cases pass: success, 429 warnings, 404 on either URL, server error and connection failure on either URL. bash -n, git diff --check and commit hook bundle validation pass.\n\nBased directly on main f6d4d680709c5c6c98b305628e04346f5ef61620; separate from PR #565. GitHub run 40198913954: the exact lychee action passed (406 checks, 392 successful, 14 excluded, zero errors); the separate DeepWiki step retried both URLs and emitted two HTTP 429 availability-unverified warnings. The lint / spec & docs job completed successfully: https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/actions/runs/40198913954/job/121185675149 . Downstream required CI and this PR's CodeQL are still running; no overall merge-readiness claim. Existing action-pinning and explicit-permissions audits already have unrelated baseline failures and are not weakened or modified here. No branch-protection, frozen ISA, Research Protocol 001 or runtime changes. Research Protocol 001 remains NOT READY. Keep draft; no merge without explicit user approval.\n\nAdditional baseline CI limitation: the action-pinning audit logged 7 tagged references and the permissions audit logged 1 missing permissions block, yet their existing python | tee steps are marked successful. Locally reproduced pipeline exit 0 versus exit 1 with pipefail; no pipeline, permissions or action-reference changes are included in this link-only correction. A green lint job must not be read as proof that these policy checks passed. Preserve this finding for a separate CI correction.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:43:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T13:46:28Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8d0b258bd591d64903015d0714be0bd43e1eeed8","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"t81dev:corrective/required-doc-links","ref":"corrective/required-doc-links","repo":{"id":1101585698,"node_id":"R_kgDOQajdIg","name":"t81-foundation","full_name":"t81dev/t81-foundation","owner":{"login":"t81dev","id":207451414,"node_id":"U_kgDODF11Fg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207451414?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev","html_url":"https://github.com/t81dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/repos","ev